## Subtrees

## locally cloned display preview - should only exist during build
static/display-preview/

## src/shared is NOT ignored here.
## Upstream (MystenLabs/sui) carries this rule, but all 45 files are committed
## there anyway, so the rule only ever hid them from a fresh checkout -- which is
## how they failed to come across in this move and left the tree unbuildable.
## MystenLabs/ML-shared-docusaurus is the nominal origin and is 13 files behind
## with 13 more diverged, so mirroring from it would delete components that ~71
## pages import. Tracked here until that is reconciled.
